                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "8d29bd33-5ff4-37ca-afc8-13ea77007f38",
                        "entry_id": "e430bcc4-c09b-3523-a111-15050d8d89b7",
                        "glosses": [
                            "распространяющийся на всю Россию, охватывающий всех россиян"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "3231e17a-0a84-42ff-99a0-23fe27fb8827",
                                "sense_id": "8d29bd33-5ff4-37ca-afc8-13ea77007f38",
                                "text": "В сущности, это был единый, общероссийский процесс, отражавший стремление не столько развалить империю, сколько реформировать её в нечто грандиозно-модернистское (в данном случае не важно — идёт ли речь о буржуазном или о коммунистическом проекте)."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "e949b4c7-406b-4775-80b2-aff2106a2cc1",
                        "source_entry_id": "e430bcc4-c09b-3523-a111-15050d8d89b7",
                        "source_sense_id": "8d29bd33-5ff4-37ca-afc8-13ea77007f38",
                        "target_lang_word": "all-Russian",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "56ee619e-48c2-45f5-ad78-886afeb9d9f0",
                        "source_entry_id": "e430bcc4-c09b-3523-a111-15050d8d89b7",
                        "source_sense_id": "8d29bd33-5ff4-37ca-afc8-13ea77007f38",
                        "target_lang_word": "nationwide",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "nationwide",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fbff97cb-bcf5-3e08-8e85-b06545062a04",
                                        "entry_id": "590c958b-8023-341e-a9cc-062e85d273ab",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Extending throughout an entire nation."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "25de1c49-a5c6-4967-9bf5-f5364d507c49",
                                                "sense_id": "fbff97cb-bcf5-3e08-8e85-b06545062a04",
                                                "text": "Near-synonym: (in federations) federal"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3532580c-df02-4d10-8f44-d36712fb7642",
                                                "sense_id": "fbff97cb-bcf5-3e08-8e85-b06545062a04",
                                                "text": "There was a nationwide search on for the bankrobbers."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "622c72ff-30e2-44ef-b10a-21a6442f0d68",
                                                "sense_id": "fbff97cb-bcf5-3e08-8e85-b06545062a04",
                                                "text": "To assist in this mind-bogglingly complex endeavour, Switzerland has developed sophisticated software tools that allow infrastructure managers (IMs), operators and local/national authorities to co-ordinate civil engineering projects with planned service enhancements, demand forecasts, pathing requirements, nationwide timetables, and asset utilisation up to 15 years ahead."
                                            },
                                            {
